:name: Helium (MVE) on the RA8M1 Cortex-M85
:description: helium_demo.elf on renesas-r7fa8m1a.repl + a debug UART (ra8m1_helium.repl).
$elf?=$ex_out/helium_demo.elf
using sysbus
mach create "ra8m1"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/ra8m1_helium.repl
showAnalyzer dbg_uart
sysbus LoadELF $elf
cpu VectorTableOffset 0x02000000
